 17 | 	return s.inner
    |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: `m.get(k)` reads an element `m` keeps, and what `m` keeps is lent, whether `m` is owned here or borrowed. Giving it away by value would take it out of `m`, and Nikaia never copies behind your back.
    = help: Write `s.inner.clone()` for a copy.
